    <div class="t-display" style="color:var(--plum);margin-bottom:20px;">Join the swap</div>
    <p class="t-body" style="color:var(--plum);max-width:700px;">Scan the QR code or tap the button below to join our WhatsApp group. Post what you have, browse what's available, and connect with other families and sports people in North Kerry.</p>
    <div style="margin-top:24px;">
      <a class="btn btn-plum" href="{{ site.whatsapp_url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Join the WhatsApp group</a>
    </div>
