    <div class="t-display" style="color:var(--plum);margin-bottom:20px;">For sports clubs</div>
    <p class="t-body" style="color:var(--plum);max-width:700px;">Got old team kits, spare equipment, or gear gathering dust in the clubhouse? We'd love to help you get it back into use. You can bulk-donate items, promote Sportswear X-Change to your members, or set up a collection point at your club.</p>
    <p class="t-body" style="color:var(--plum);margin-top:16px;">Get in touch: <a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}" style="text-decoration:underline">{{ site.email }}</a></p>
  </div>

  <div class="gi-section" id="businesses" style="padding: 48px 0; border-top: 3px solid var(--plum);">
    <div class="t-display" style="color:var(--plum);margin-bottom:20px;">For businesses and community spaces</div>
    <p class="t-body" style="color:var(--plum);max-width:700px;">Interested in becoming a pick-up point? If you're a supermarket, community centre, sports facility, or local business, hosting a SportsXChange collection point is a simple way to support your community and show your commitment to sustainability.</p>
    <p class="t-body" style="color:var(--plum);margin-top:16px;">Get in touch: <a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}" style="text-decoration:underline">{{ site.email }}</a></p>
  </div>

  <div class="gi-section" style="padding: 48px 0; border-top: 3px solid var(--plum);">
    <div class="t-display" style="color:var(--plum);margin-bottom:20px;">Spread the word</div>
    <p class="t-body" style="color:var(--plum);max-width:700px;">Know someone who could use this? Share the link to this website, or download our flyer and pass it on to your club, school, or community group.</p>
    <div style="margin-top:24px;">
      <a class="btn btn-outline-plum" href="#">Download our flyer →</a>
